'''Dumpster Diver''' is an {{Rarity|u|nolink=y}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from water in the {{zone|Backwater Bayou}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Dumpster Diver''' can be fished up from water in the {{zone|Backwater Bayou}}. It requires {{skl|fishing|5}} or higher to be fished up.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''Dumpster Diver''' is {{Green|2,875}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|28.75%|1|3.48|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Currently there are no modifiers that can be used to increase it.
